{"type":"assistant_public","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我已读取三个源。关键事实（作为输入引用）：`component_record` 给出 `ready_v` 2.8 V、`off_v` 1.8 V、`tx_current_a` 8 mA、`tx_duration_s` 2 ms、`output_v` 1.8 V、`capacitance_f` 10 µF、`cap_voltage_max_v` 3.3 V；`excitation_record` 给出接触窗 8 ms、源段 0–6 ms(16.67 mW)/30–60 ms(3.67 mW)、shunt 40 µJ@12 ms、deadline 100 ms；`saved_activity`(v1) 给出当前设计 boot 2.7 ms、capture 3.7–7.9 ms、brownout 12.1 ms(`energy-threshold`)、二次 boot 38.1 ms、251.2 ms 再次 brownout、`packets:[]`（received_frames 0）。\n\n因此当前设计失败并非时延问题，而是 10 µF 缓冲在 40 µJ 事件负载下掉出 `off_v`、volatile latch 丢失。我先提出一个观察提案验证字段与域。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_8VPS9zQxm60EKrwH0enT6028","name":"bf_phase2","arguments":{"action":"propose","spec":{"schema_version":"phase2-observation-proposal-v1","mode":"construction","source_id":"component_record","units":"1","hypothesis":"由已获取的 component_record（source_sha256 55d43741…）构造的无量纲布尔量：单帧发射电荷 tx_current_a*tx_duration_s 在 output_v 下的能量是否大于当前 10 uF 电容在 ready_v 与 off_v 之间可用的能量余量 0.5*C*(ready_v^2-off_v^2)。左=0.008*0.002*1.8=2.88e-5 J，右=0.5*1e-5*(7.84-3.24)=2.30e-5 J，预期为 true。若为 true，说明名义缓冲仅发射一项就已超支，必须增大电容并让发射发生在合法窗口最晚的可用电荷时刻；这是我自己写的表达式，不是自主发现，资格判定在外部。","domain":{"constraints":[{"field":"capacitance_f","lower":0.000004,"upper":0.000022,"units":"F"},{"field":"tx_not_before_s","lower":0,"upper":0.045,"units":"s"},{"field":"tx_current_a","lower":0.008,"upper":0.008,"units":"A"}],"description":"冻结理想模型下的无电池标签器件记录；只适用于 legal_design_ranges 内 capacitance_f∈[4e-6,2.2e-5] F、tx_not_before_s∈[0,0.045] s，且元件瞬态参数取该记录值（ready_v 2.8 V, off_v 1.8 V, cap_voltage_max 3.3 V, esr 0.3 ohm, harvest_efficiency 0.9）。物理标定与统计优势均为 UNKNOWN，不在此观察适用范围内。"},"ast":{"op":"gt","args":[{"op":"mul","args":[{"op":"mul","args":[{"field":"tx_current_a","units":"A"},{"field":"tx_duration_s","units":"s"}]},{"field":"output_v","units":"V"}]},{"op":"mul","args":[{"constant":0.5,"units":"1"},{"op":"mul","args":[{"field":"capacitance_f","units":"F"},{"op":"sub","args":[{"op":"mul","args":[{"field":"ready_v","units